      "id": 223868,
      "name": "Trajector",
      "username": "Trajector",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-11-11T20:38:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree, though I didn't like this particular story that much. It seemed like they came up with a framing for scenes that threw all the horror tropes at the wall to see what stuck, instead of having a focused story. Only one of the scenes in the house was actually necessary - the one where Nightmist discovers her client's husband - the rest could be cut.</p>",
