      "raw": "<p>I agree, though I didn't like this particular story that much. It seemed like they came up with a framing for scenes that threw all the horror tropes at the wall to see what stuck, instead of having a focused story. Only one of the scenes in the house was actually necessary - the one where Nightmist discovers her client's husband - the rest could be cut.</p>",
